0.102 0.102 0.102 rg BT /F3 12 Tf 108 480 Td (During that week I noticed three things. I finished my work faster. I remembered what the) Tj ET
0.102 0.102 0.102 rg BT /F3 12 Tf 72 456 Td (teacher said. And at the end of the lesson I did not feel tired in the strange way that I do) Tj ET
0.102 0.102 0.102 rg BT /F3 12 Tf 72 432 Td (after scrolling. That was surprising, because I had expected to be bored and annoyed.) Tj ET
0.102 0.102 0.102 rg BT /F3 12 Tf 108 408 Td (Of course there are things to be careful about. Some students need a phone for health) Tj ET
0.102 0.102 0.102 rg BT /F3 12 Tf 72 384 Td (reasons, such as checking their blood sugar, and those students must always be able to keep) Tj ET
